      "description": "•Participate in all phases of the software development life cycle (SDLC) including the requirements gathering, design, development for bugs and enhancements, testing, deployment and ongoing support. \n•Completed Thomson Reuters sponsored self-paced mobile training by learning Objective-c and Xcode and completing a project which included upgrading a paid news application to iPhone 5 support, enhanced login for internal testing, adding Bango ID for analytics and fixing bugs related to landscape views for video and a real-time streaming news ticker at the top of the main view.\n•Key contributor of re-write and re-design of a reporting website for sales representatives.\n•Designed and developed an administration tool for an enterprise-level application using Silverlight and MVVM.\n•Developed and implemented a major enhancement which allows users to report on all products within one instance of QuickView+, improving the customer experience.\n•Created Informatica mapping processes that inserts and updates database information.\n•Successfully collaborate with numerous Thomson Reuters teams and colleagues around the world to create the best online products for our customers.",
